  "notes": [
    "Fee sign: OKX fillFee negative = fee charged, positive = rebate. Canonical fee = -fillFee (0.0000008 cost; the second fill's +0.0000004 rebate becomes -0.0000004). Use per-update fillFee, never the cumulative fee.",
    "Fill ts_exchange = fillTime (match_time); state-change rows use uTime (record_time).",
    "tradeId 242589201 is pushed twice (second with a later uTime): dedupe on (instId, tradeId).",
    "Amend recognised by reqId/amendResult=0; sz is the new total target qty. Priority undocumented -> null.",
    "clOrdId \"\" means no client id -> client_order_id null.",
    "cancelSource: 31 post-only would take -> post_only_reject; 32 STP and 14 IOC remainder -> expire; 1 user -> cancel_ack. ordType post_only -> tif post_only, ioc -> tif ioc.",
    "OKX tag -> strategy_tag (importer choice)."
